[{"code":"not_implemented","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":11,"col":10},"end":{"line":11,"col":11}},"title":"NOT IMPLEMENTED YET","message":"`browser-direct` does not compile markup as a value yet — markup that is not the\n`view` a program constructor is called with (held, passed or returned by another\nfunction, or a `view` that is `pub` or used elsewhere), `Html.text` and\n`Html.map` — it arrives with slice S4 (`docs/design/browser-direct.md` §5.2,\n§14). Build this program with `--platform=browser-tea` until then."},{"code":"view_not_compiled","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":15,"col":85},"end":{"line":15,"col":96}},"title":"VIEW NOT COMPILED","message":"`Tea.sandbox` is used here as a value rather than called with its record, so the\nprogram it makes, and that program's `view`, are known only when the page runs.\n\nThe markup lowering `direct` compiles each program where its constructor is\ncalled (`docs/design/browser-direct.md` §11.1), and has no renderer to hand a\n`view` it did not compile. Call `Tea.sandbox` with the program's record here, or\nbuild for `--platform=browser-tea`, which renders any `view`."}]
